"about_license_body" = "Parts of the course-import adapters in this app are based on the publicly available implementations of the following open-source projects. They are organized in two tiers: cross-university foundational projects and per-school projects. Tap a school card to expand and view all student-maintained projects referenced for that school.\n\nCross-university foundational projects: WakeUp Schedule (YZune, Apache-2.0) and WakeupSchedule_BUPT (dIT8Zv, Apache-2.0) — reference implementations for twelve educational-system parsers (Qingzhi and variants, legacy Zhengfang, URP, Chengfang, HNUST); WakeupSchedule_Kotlin (Apache-2.0) for classic Wisedu EAMS; the cqu.js adapter from Shiguang Schedule for Chongqing University portal REST; shiguang_warehouse (XingHeYuZhuan, MIT) for WHUT kcbcxby, classic EAMS and new-Zhengfang grid view; zfn_api (openschoolcn, MPL-2.0) and FlowCourse (jiaweiyaya, GPL-3.0) for new-Zhengfang kbList cross-validation; iwut (TokenTeam, AGPL-3.0, protocol shape only) for WHUT section mapping; Shangke Schedule shangkeschedule (qiqqqqq517, Apache-2.0) and WakeUp Schedule school registries used for cross-checking our school list.\n\nPer-school attribution (one card per school, expand to see details) — Hefei University of Technology HFUT: HFUT-Schedule (Chiu-xaH, MIT), HfutOpenApi (BoynChan, MIT), hfut_schedule_hacker (Aoi-cn), django-hfut-auth (elonzh, MIT); Southeast University SEU: SEUTimetable (sakimidare, Apache-2.0), Aetik-yue/hormone, luzy99/SEUAutoLogin; Zhejiang University ZJU: zju-ical-py (Xecades, LGPL-2.1); USTC: USTC-timetable-to-ics (1970633640); Sichuan University SCU: ScuTimetable (Z-P-J); Northeastern University NEU: neu_wisedu2wakeup (CreamPig233), PopulusYang/NeuTimetable, neucn/elise, RekaYOO/NEU-JWXT-Toolkit, PeterPtroc/neu-jwxt-to-wakeup, leavesvv-source/NEU-Timetable; Chongqing University CQU: 321CQU/pymycqu, BillYang2016/CQU-class2ics, haowang02/CourseMonitor, LengerHu/CQU_classtabletoics, Hagb/cqu_timetable_new, VayneDuan/CQU-Grade-Monitor, weearc/cm-http-api, barryZZJ/course_to_calander_converter; Wuhan University of Technology WHUT: courseTable (acm910); UESTC: MilLoong/UESTC-EAMS-Helper-App, MilLoong/UESTC-EAMS-Helper-Python, KaranocaVe/UESTCJWCWatchdog, whtsky/uestc-eams-cleartimeout-userscript, Sunmxt/UESTC-EAMS; Guangdong University of Technology GDUT: N0tExpectErr0r/GDUT-ClassTimeTable, Richard-Zheng/GDUT-Schedule-ng, StarArchive/gdut-course-frontend, StarArchive/gdut-course-backend, HoneQ7/GDUT_iOS_Timetable; Guangdong University of Finance and Economics GDUFE: jkgeekJack/Android-GDUFE-JWC-SDK-1.0.0, Kiteio/GDUFE-wrapper; Guangdong University of Finance GDUf: Kiteio/Punica, gduf-finmind; Guangdong University of Foreign Studies GDUFS: yongjianzheng/Gdufszhushou, Crazioker/agency; Guangdong Medical University GDMU: user-supplied capture package confirmed zf_new protocol (new ZhengFang zftal-ui-v5 bare /kbcx/ path), see docs/release-notes-v1.0.49.md; Changsha University of Science and Technology CSUST: zHElEARN/CSUSTKit, CreaMakers/EduSpider, timeisthe/CSUSTDataGet, Julius-lq/EduAdminSystem, JS-CAUTION/csust-course-schedule; Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications BUPT: helium777/bupt-course-grab, JmPotato/BUPT-Grader, Seizzzz/Auto-Login-BUPT; Peking University PKU: zhongxinghong/PKUAutoElective, thezzisu/pku-elective, Hovennnnn/PKUAutoElective2023, Lihhan/AutoElective_4_PKU, AuYang261/PKU_Elective_Toolset; Beijing University of Chemical Technology BUCT: MarkYangKp/ZhengFangJY; University of Chinese Academy of Sciences UCAS: ldiex/UCAS_Course_Schedule_Convertor (Python, 13-section + course-week mapping), Hurray0/UCAS_GET_Course (Python, xkgo.ucas.ac.cn course-fetch script), cld378632668/ucas_course_tool (Java, UCAS course utility), GentleCP/UCAS-Helper (TypeScript, UCAS course/grade helper); Beihang University BUAA: APassbyDreg/BUAA_JW_Utils (Python toolset, ieas2.1 course-select + evaluation URL anchors), SE2020-TopUnderstanding/BUAA-Campus-Tools-Backend (Python, jwxt-7001.e2.buaa.edu.cn/ieas2.1/kbcx/queryGrkb schedule endpoint), fondoger/buaa-teacher-evaluation (MIT, one-click evaluation via sso.buaa.edu.cn CAS), Cauchy1412/BUAAGetCourse (Python course-grabber script), KKRainbow/JWOneShotEval (PHP, intra-campus IP anchor); Beijing Forestry University BJFU: Bloomberg2000/bjfu_course_ics_generator, Bloomberg2000/bjfu_util.py; Anhui University AHU: MoeclubM/AHU-AIO (Dart, new academic REST client, lib/jw/api/jw_api.dart), qiqqqqq517/shangkeschschedule (Apache-2.0) AHU adapter (WebVPN+CAS+get-data protocol family consensus, ahu.js), abydym/Ahu_Plus (GPL-3.0, Kotlin same-stack, JwModels.kt+CourseRepository.kt print-data+get-data dual-track), Landon-3314/AHU-TimeTable (Flutter, academic_course_api_parser.dart print-data activities field mapping), Zeraora-807/Anhui-Univ-DSH-Tool (TypeScript DeepSeek Harness, print-data studentTableVms extraction), MuxYang/AhuCourseSelectCLI (Python course-select CLI, NEGATIVE: course-selection-api protocol family outside EAMS5), Tonyseth/AHU_JW_GPA_Calculator (userscript GPA, INDIRECT), curdbin/AHU-API (Python, NEGATIVE: legacy ZhengFang ASP.NET jw1.ahu.cn/jw2.ahu.cn), UponNoise/AHU_SBI_DMT (Python, NEGATIVE: legacy ZhengFang jwxt3.ahu.edu.cn); Northeast Forestry University NEFU: bboy-xp/nefu-crawler, heyMahalo/crouse_select; Donghua University DHU: tk.dcmmcc, Bad-086/DHU_CourseMonitor; Yunnan University of Finance and Economics YNUFE: NINIYOYYO/ynufe-campus-app, MiaoWuNYA/ynufeRealLogin; Beijing Institute of Technology BIT: BIT-Login (BIT101-dev); Beijing Information Science and Technology University BISTU: iBistu (ProjektMing); Anhui Jianzhu University AHU-JZ: JdaAssist (CH4019, MIT); Chongqing College of Mobile Telecommunications CQYTU: CQYTZFCheckScores (xM3GAN, Apache-2.0); South China Agricultural University SCAU: ScheduleXParser_SCAU (greyovo); Qilu University of Technology QLU: JW-spider (Zhy423310825); Bohai University BHU: BohaiServiceDome (joun233); Northeast Petroleum University NEPU: WeNEPU (cutiechi); Nanjing University of Science and Technology NUST: HeraldStudentCurriculum (idailylife).";
